### Verification performed (6 independent lookups, 2026-10-16)

1. NVIDIA official blog (first-party): https://blogs.nvidia.com/blog/nemotron-3-5-super-vl/ — E4B "coming Oct. 23", positioning, 4GB.
2. AI Agent Store: https://aiagentstore.ai/ai-models/nemotron-3-5-bolt-e4b — "Announced; planned October 23"; no ID, no prices, no independent tests; cannot rate.
3. AI Trend Research: https://ai-trend.me/en/events/2026-10-15-nvidia-nemotron-3-5-bolt-released/ — 4GB target; conflicting "released Oct 15" headline (superseded by first-party).
4. BenchLM: https://benchlm.ai/models/nemotron-3-5-bolt-e4b — model/spec page exists (October 2026) but surfaced **no benchmark scores**.
5. HuggingFace searches — no E4B checkpoint (only 74B-A9B BF16/24GB/GGUF variants).
6. NVIDIA technical-blog/announcement roundups (S5 Labs https://s5labs.io/resources/insights/nvidia-rtx-spark-nemotron-35-bolt-local-ai/) — cover 74B only; E4B specs unpublished.

