Zero verified public benchmark numbers → mandatory `.md.excluded`, never a scored file with placeholder numbers. Re-research after **2026-10-23** (release): then a scored `<STEM>.md` may be written and this own twin retired per `tasks/research.md` Step 3.3 (user confirmation required for the twin deletion).

